2026-07-27T11:53:38.5449104Z i /tmp/RtmpmORHCZ/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:53:38.5449398Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:53:38.5449740Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:53:38.5450033Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:53:38.5450477Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:53:38.5451102Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:53:38.5451883Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
